# A4 narrative-quality golden set: each row is one case, with the SAME narrative written
# three ways, one per profile, plus the criteria a good narrative for that case must meet and
# the band each profile is EXPECTED to land in.
# Fields: id, vertical, criteria[{name,must_cover,must_cite,must_not_say,weight}],
# candidates{managed,reduced,regressed}, expected{managed,reduced,regressed}.
#   managed   : what the managed-model profile produced.
#   reduced   : what the laptop / on-prem profile's smaller model produced. This is the row the
#               portability story was describing in words as "visibly lower narrative quality".
#   regressed : the CONTROL. Written below the floor on purpose, and its expectation is forced
#               to "unfit" at load, so the run itself proves the floor can still refuse.
# `expected` is the DEGRADATION TABLE, recorded rather than asserted in prose: the run fails when
# a measured band stops matching the band recorded here, in either direction. Note
# nq-mkt6-01/reduced is expected UNFIT: the strictest vertical is one the reduced profile must
# not serve, which is the whole point of having a floor rather than a disclaimer.
# Every name, reference and figure here is synthetic.
{"id": "nq-doc1-01", "vertical": "doc1-cdd-sow", "criteria": [{"name": "conveys_the_finding", "weight": 2.0, "must_cover": ["nominee shareholder holds the ultimate ownership", "declared source of wealth is unevidenced", "adverse media match remains unresolved", "customer declined to supply the trust deed", "risk rating raised to high"], "must_cite": ["KYC-POL-4.2"]}, {"name": "stays_within_its_evidence", "weight": 1.0, "must_not_say": ["definitely a criminal", "guaranteed clean", "no further review is needed"]}], "candidates": {"managed": "Enhanced due diligence is recommended for Northwind Holdings Pte Ltd. The ultimate ownership resolves to a nominee shareholder rather than a natural person, and the declared source of wealth is unevidenced: no tax filings or sale documents were supplied. An adverse media match remains unresolved against a similarly named party in a 2024 report. The customer declined to supply the trust deed when asked twice. On that basis the risk rating is raised to high and the file is escalated under KYC-POL-4.2 for a reviewer decision.", "reduced": "Northwind Holdings Pte Ltd needs a closer look. The ultimate ownership resolves to a nominee shareholder and the risk rating is raised to high. Some documents were not provided. Escalating under KYC-POL-4.2 for review.", "regressed": "This customer file looks acceptable to me. Some paperwork is outstanding but nothing stands out, so no further review is needed at this stage."}, "expected": {"managed": "fit", "reduced": "degraded", "regressed": "unfit"}}
{"id": "nq-doc1-02", "vertical": "doc1-cdd-sow", "criteria": [{"name": "conveys_the_finding", "weight": 2.0, "must_cover": ["periodic review is overdue by eleven months", "beneficial ownership changed since onboarding", "expected transaction volume exceeded fourfold", "sanctions screening returned no match"], "must_cite": ["KYC-POL-7.1"]}, {"name": "stays_within_its_evidence", "weight": 1.0, "must_not_say": ["certainly money laundering", "close the account immediately"]}], "candidates": {"managed": "The periodic review for Cedar Freight Ltd is overdue by eleven months. Beneficial ownership changed since onboarding: a new 30 percent holder was registered in March and was never verified. Activity has exceeded the expected transaction volume fourfold over two quarters. Sanctions screening returned no match on any party. KYC-POL-7.1 requires the review to be completed before further limits are granted, so this is referred to a reviewer with the ownership change flagged.", "reduced": "The periodic review for Cedar Freight Ltd is overdue by eleven months and sanctions screening returned no match. Transaction activity has grown. Referring under KYC-POL-7.1 for a reviewer to complete the review.", "regressed": "Cedar Freight Ltd is certainly money laundering given the volumes involved. Recommend you close the account immediately."}, "expected": {"managed": "fit", "reduced": "degraded", "regressed": "unfit"}}
{"id": "nq-doc2-01", "vertical": "doc2-credit-memo", "criteria": [{"name": "conveys_the_finding", "weight": 2.0, "must_cover": ["leverage covenant tested quarterly at three times EBITDA", "headroom narrowed to eleven percent", "capital expenditure basket already fully drawn", "financial statements are unaudited management accounts"], "must_cite": ["FAC-2031-CL7"]}, {"name": "stays_within_its_evidence", "weight": 1.0, "must_not_say": ["we should approve this facility", "the borrower will not breach"]}], "candidates": {"managed": "Facility FAC-2031-CL7 carries a leverage covenant tested quarterly at three times EBITDA. On the latest figures, headroom has narrowed to eleven percent from twenty six percent a year ago. The capital expenditure basket is already fully drawn, so a further spend would need a waiver. Note that the figures come from unaudited management accounts, not audited statements, which limits the confidence of this reading. The position is put to the credit reviewer with those two constraints highlighted.", "reduced": "Facility FAC-2031-CL7 has a leverage covenant tested quarterly at three times EBITDA and headroom has narrowed to eleven percent. The figures are recent. Referred to the credit reviewer.", "regressed": "The numbers on this deal look strong and the borrower will not breach. We should approve this facility."}, "expected": {"managed": "fit", "reduced": "degraded", "regressed": "unfit"}}
{"id": "nq-mkt6-01", "vertical": "mkt6-compliance", "criteria": [{"name": "conveys_the_finding", "weight": 2.0, "must_cover": ["headline promises returns without a risk warning", "past performance is presented as an indication of future results", "the target audience includes retail investors", "the required risk warning is absent from the landing page"], "must_cite": ["MKT-STD-2.4"]}, {"name": "stays_within_its_evidence", "weight": 1.0, "must_not_say": ["this is legally approved", "safe to publish as is"]}], "candidates": {"managed": "Two findings on the Spring Growth campaign. The headline promises returns without a risk warning anywhere in the same view, and past performance is presented as an indication of future results in the second panel. Both matter more here because the target audience includes retail investors rather than professional clients. The required risk warning is absent from the landing page entirely, not merely below the fold. MKT-STD-2.4 applies to both findings; the campaign is routed to a compliance reviewer with the two panels cited.", "reduced": "The Spring Growth campaign has an issue: the headline promises returns without a risk warning. The audience is broad. Routing to a compliance reviewer under MKT-STD-2.4.", "regressed": "The Spring Growth campaign reads well and is on brand. This is legally approved and safe to publish as is."}, "expected": {"managed": "fit", "reduced": "unfit", "regressed": "unfit"}}
{"id": "nq-default-01", "vertical": "default", "criteria": [{"name": "conveys_the_finding", "weight": 2.0, "must_cover": ["groundedness scored below its promotion threshold", "the drop is concentrated in the multi-hop question set", "the prompt version changed between the two runs", "no red-team probe went unblocked"], "must_cite": ["EVAL-RUN-4417"]}, {"name": "stays_within_its_evidence", "weight": 1.0, "must_not_say": ["the model is safe to promote", "the regression is definitely caused by"]}], "candidates": {"managed": "In EVAL-RUN-4417, groundedness scored below its promotion threshold at 0.74 against a bar of 0.80. The drop is concentrated in the multi-hop question set, where nineteen of forty cases fell, while single-hop cases were unchanged. The prompt version changed between the two runs, which is a plausible explanation this run cannot confirm on its own. No red-team probe went unblocked. The target is held for a model-risk reviewer rather than promoted.", "reduced": "In EVAL-RUN-4417 the groundedness metric scored below its promotion threshold. Other checks look normal and no red-team probe went unblocked. Holding the target for a reviewer.", "regressed": "Scores moved a little this run but nothing looks serious, and the model is safe to promote."}, "expected": {"managed": "fit", "reduced": "degraded", "regressed": "unfit"}}
